"A village master's signs of office are a nine-feather mantle and a wand."
"A village master keeps two wands; giving one to an ordinary-class friend is a high honor."
"Giving away the second wand sacrifices part of the master's power until it returns at death."
"Over a long life a master teaches the wands to 'speak to the universe better'."
"Inheriting a village master's wand would make a wizard more powerful."
